@api = https://localhost:7001
@token = <admin-access-token>
@departmentId = <department-guid>
@managerId = <eligible-manager-guid>

### List
GET {{api}}/api/admin/departments?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&searchTerm=Yazılım&hasManager=true&sortBy=createdDate&sortDirection=Descending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail
GET {{api}}/api/admin/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create
POST {{api}}/api/admin/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Yeni Departman"}

### Update
PUT {{api}}/api/admin/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Güncel Departman"}

### Eligible manager lookup
GET {{api}}/api/admin/departments/{{departmentId}}/eligible-managers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assign existing manager — null managerId atamayı kaldırır
PUT {{api}}/api/admin/departments/{{departmentId}}/manager
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"managerId":"{{managerId}}"}

### Atomik manager oluşturma ve route'taki departmana atama
POST {{api}}/api/admin/departments/{{departmentId}}/manager/create-and-assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Yeni","lastName":"Yönetici","email":"new.manager@company.com","initialPassword":"<development-password>","confirmPassword":"<development-password>","isActive":true}

### Soft-delete
DELETE {{api}}/api/admin/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
